      "content": "The symptoms you're describing could be related to kidney stones, but it's also possible that there's an underlying issue. The pulsing sensation in your stomach when lying down could be related to the movement of the stones, but it's also a common symptom of conditions like gastroesophageal reflux disease (GERD) or constipation. You should consult a doctor to confirm the diagnosis and rule out any other potential causes.",
